sequenceDiagram
    actor Master as Wellness Admin
    participant MasterSDK as Wellness Admin WalletSdk
    participant Provider as Provider Dashboard
    participant EmployeeSDK as Employee WalletSdk
    participant Roster as Local Employee Roster

    Master->>Provider: Create replacement API key
    Provider-->>Master: Old and new keys active
    Master->>MasterSDK: Save configuration version N plus 1
    loop Each Employee device
        EmployeeSDK-->>MasterSDK: Configuration request QR
        MasterSDK-->>EmployeeSDK: Device-bound update QR
        EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSDK: Validate, health-check, and commit
        opt Confirmation receipt is used
            EmployeeSDK-->>MasterSDK: Applied-version receipt QR
            MasterSDK->>Roster: Mark device updated
        end
    end
    Master->>Roster: Review migration policy and known device status
    Master->>Provider: Revoke old key after overlap window
